    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the professional stuff... it's just more noise. i'm not looking for a 'fix' or a coping mechanism. i just feel like i've completed my part. like a book that's already been read and put away on a dusty shelf. there's no point in trying to force a new chapter when the story is clearly over, you know?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
