      "content": "\"peace in knowing when something has run its course\"... that sounds almost beautiful when you put it like that. like it's not a tragedy, just a natural conclusion. do you really think it's okay to just... let go, instead of fighting to stay in a world that doesn't have a place for you anymore?",
